<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's BYC 1996 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's BYC 1996 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	 (billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net Profit			  13.8   vs	 10.4</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		 20.1   vs	 16.3</p>
<p>    Turnover			   338.2   vs	374.6</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won, in cash)</p>
<p>		 common shares	  15     vs	 15</p>
<p>		 preferred shares     16     vs	 16</p>
<p>    Extrordinary	 (gain)	0.77  vs (loss) 0.44</p>
<p>Note - South Korea's BYC Co Ltd's share capital stood unchanged at 840,000 shares.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
